{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在旅行途中或日常處理外語內容，又不想把文字上傳到伺服器？《On-Device AI Translator》把翻譯模型直接放在 iPhone 本機，即使身處飛機模式亦能即時翻譯，適合重視私隱與離線操作的人士。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-4.webp\">\n<h2>本機模型離線翻譯</h2>\n<p>翻譯模型留在 iPhone 本機，輸入文字不會離開裝置，飛機模式下仍可運作。系統翻譯免費且毋須下載模型，亦可改用騰訊 Hy-MT2、Google TranslateGemma 4B、Qwen3 及 Qwen2.5 等本機 AI 模型，按裝置記憶體與翻譯質素取捨，下載後全程離線。程式支援二十種語言，可設為預設翻譯 App，在其他應用選取文字後直接翻譯並替換原文，全程毋須帳戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-47-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-48-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-49-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-50-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-51-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：On-Device AI Translator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Reference</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.915245+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":380,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T23:51:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:17:44.803794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:15.048916+00:00","content_hash":"ec30cb4b2dff7da484b077c31bf22d7911b4109d5de8fd9d3ec635598fbd064c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}